      },
      "message": "fix(app): migrate legacy patch keys to operation picks and clean clippy findings\n\n- Migrate legacy wire start and links approach start/exit points into picks in MCP and script patches.\n- Resolve open cutoff checks in Agie native profile to read wire picks start.\n- Update Wire EDM unit test to clear picks start list instead of setting removed field.\n- Collapse nested if expressions in path_picks_dto to satisfy clippy collapsible_if.\n- Replace raw slice indexing with first_mut in start and exit pick UI helpers.\n- Remove redundant source alias from OperationDto src field.\n- Document contour operation digest changes and legacy patch migration in decision file.\n\nRefs #3339",
      "tree": {
